Special Unit: - [CodeName]- Patcher ST-1616 [Specialization]- Medical/ Torture [Affiliation]- 228th Black Skulls {Exclusively}

Special unit Patcher is the medical clone assigned to help the torture troopers. The Reaper Troopers and the Terror Troopers. His job is to maintain the life of the hostile in between sessions. He is also trained to be able to stick the knife wherever he so pleases and use the dull flat side of the blade to stop the bleeding. He is not trained for combat, but for sure can hold for sure hold his own.

~

Uncommon Unit: - [CodeName]- Ripper - UT-5576 [Specialization]- Shredding [Affiliation]- 228th Black Skulls {Exclusively}

The Uncommon Trooper of the 228th Black Skulls known as the “Ripper” specializes close-quarter rushing and combat. With the use of 228th Cloaking Technology they charge in cloaked and right before they get to their first target the will uncloak and use their two combat blades and will slice and dice the hostile in every possible way within a few seconds and then will proceed to cloak and move on.

~
